# Persisted inference artifacts are intentionally versioned: Render must serve
# genuine saved models rather than silently falling back to demonstrations.
# deploy_snapshot/ and data/processed/ are small, checksum-verified and versioned
# so hosted adapters can answer without the raw collection.
